{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日(31日)凌晨4時19分，警方接獲一名姓梁(33歲)男子報案指，在友愛邨愛德樓對開遭兩名男子襲擊，並企圖搶去其財物。</p><p>警員接報到場前，兩名賊人已逃去無縱，事主表示未有損失，惟口及手擦傷，清醒被送往屯門醫院治理。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.498323+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T02:53:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.050727+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.050727+00:00","content_hash":"d8c78a7f7ccc3bbc96ebdd8489804542808845e932b3cb40f5f4bbb7ee652c95","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}